{"unit_id":"nanshanzhaoji__dsh-download-progress#card-zh","repo":"nanshanzhaoji/dsh-download-progress","commit":"052917db31285668140a85e14cd5e4636ab644e1","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-download-progress（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为文件下载提供实时进度展示。它向 DSH 注册 download 工具，并通过宿主路由向浏览器提供下载状态，由 Web 悬浮面板显示进度。主要功能包括流式下载、百分比与速度统计、重定向跟随、取消下载和完成状态查看。适合需要在 DSH Web 界面跟踪文件下载的用户。调用时提供 HTTP(S) 地址，可选指定工作区内的保存路径；无需额外密钥配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:91-128","lib/index.js:157-195","lib/client.js:40-80"]}
{"unit_id":"nanshanzhaoji__dsh-download-progress#card-en","repo":"nanshanzhaoji/dsh-download-progress","commit":"052917db31285668140a85e14cd5e4636ab644e1","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-download-progress is a DSH Web plugin for tracking file downloads. Its download tool streams HTTP(S) responses to a workspace path, while a floating panel shows percentage, transferred size, and speed. It follows redirects and handles cancellation. No API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:91-128","lib/index.js:157-195","lib/client.js:40-80"]}
