{"unit_id":"nanshanzhaoji__dsh-download-progress#feature-stream-download","repo":"nanshanzhaoji/dsh-download-progress","commit":"052917db31285668140a85e14cd5e4636ab644e1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-download-progress 的功能「流式文件下载」：从 HTTP(S) 地址读取响应并写入工作区目标文件，同时统计接收字节数。可传入保存路径，未提供时使用 URL 路径中的文件名。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:91-107","lib/index.js:231-266"]}
